1
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:45,960
<i>They say a person
brushes past about 1,000 people a day.</i>

2
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:51,440
<i>In all that crowd, you never know when or where</i>

3
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:54,400
<i>you'll run into someone again.</i>

4
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:57,400
<i>It might be an old acquaintance,</i>

5
00:01:57,400 --> 00:02:01,560
<i>or it might be the person you used to be.</i>

6
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:38,160
[Episode 2]
[Fate, Like a Dream]

7
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:53,920
[Striking female pilot in the making]
[Qin Island Aviation Academy Students]

8
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:12,600
<i>We're bringing in the new model,
but we still need an answer,</i>

9
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:17,720
<i>the kind that can
solve Hengshi Air's problem at its source.</i>

10
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,480
<i>Go to Qingdao right now.</i>

11
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,960
<i>You have full personnel authority.</i>

12
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:33,440
<i>Do whatever it takes to sign that trainee.</i>

13
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:35,450
<i>Failure is not acceptable.</i>

14
00:03:35,450 --> 00:03:37,320
<i>Yes, Mr. Fu.</i>

15
00:03:38,951 --> 00:03:42,480
I know many airlines have been courting you.

16
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:44,600
Name your signing bonus, any number.

17
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:49,200
And any other terms you can dream of,
of course.

18
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,040
Just say it.

19
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:56,720
I'll take the contract
and get back to you in a few days.

20
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,120
Sure thing.

21
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:03,593
As long as it's not a no,
I'll wait till the cows come home.

22
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,360
But honestly,

23
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:11,800
getting a commercial pilot license
is an immense hardship.

24
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:15,720
It breaks even the toughest guys,

25
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:22,000
let alone a beautiful girl like you.

26
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,240
Ms. Ruan, I truly admire how you

27
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:30,760
not only made it through
but topped every single test.

28
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,360
You're a miracle!

29
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:35,320
Pilots don't have a "top spot."

30
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:37,759
Mr. Yan, you're flattering me too much.

31
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:38,880
Oh really?

32
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:43,400
Your squadron leader and your advisor
all sang your praises.

33
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:46,040
To them, you're number one.

34
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:50,000
But to me, you're not number one.

35
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:56,000
You are the only one.

36
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:01,200
Sorry, Ms. Ruan.

37
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:05,879
First time meeting you,
and I've already lost my immunity.

38
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:07,680
Sorry.

39
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:13,160
Sorry to ask, Mr. Yan.

40
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:18,960
Is your airline considering
any domestically built large jets?

41
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,040
How large?

42
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,080
Why would you go domestic?

43
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:31,439
Pick any foreign model you like.
I'll get it for you.

44
00:05:31,439 --> 00:05:33,400
Thank you.

45
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:38,080
Mr. Yan, drive safely.

46
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:40,120
Take it easy.

47
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:51,400
Ms. Ruan? I just called you.

48
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:04,600
- You...
<i>- Mr. Bai. Your coffee. Enjoy.</i>

49
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,680
I... You... How...

50
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:12,640
Long time no see, Mr. Bai.

51
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,960
I was thinking,

52
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:18,879
could this be the Ruan Si Xian I know,
the former star of Hengshi Air?

53
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:21,160
It's been three years.

54
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:24,879
Your hair's shorter,
but you're still as striking as ever.

55
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:27,000
Has your boss changed?

56
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:33,680
No? Then Hengshi Air is still alive?

57
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,360
You guys must be working hard.

58
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,200
Ms. Ruan, about what happened
three years ago...

59
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,680
No need, Mr. Bai.

60
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,680
Water under the bridge.

61
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,960
Are you free today?

62
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:47,040
I'd really like to talk.

63
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:49,760
You came all the way here.

64
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:52,640
Did he send you?

65
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:56,680
- More or less.
- I'm sorry, Mr. Bai.

66
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:59,319
If I had a ranking of airlines I'd sign with,

67
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:03,759
I don't know who'd be top,
but I know the very last one.

68
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:05,720
Hengshi Air.

69
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,040
I've got training.

70
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,640
I'm done here.

71
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:11,440
Ms. Ruan! I...

72
00:07:12,776 --> 00:07:15,480
<i>I hope that's good news.</i>

73
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,040
Well, sort of.

74
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:21,720
She's the fastest graduate in this batch,
top marks across the board.

75
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,680
<i>So, she's the number one.</i>

76
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,440
I know all that.

77
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,839
Tell me, did she say yes?

78
00:07:26,839 --> 00:07:30,520
She hasn't said yes to any airline yet, but...

79
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,000
She flat-out turned us down.

80
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,920
She turned down Hengshi Air directly?

81
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:36,840
<i>Yes, straight refusal.</i>

82
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:41,639
Whatever Yan An offers, we can match it.

83
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:43,920
Even double it. Did you tell her that?

84
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:49,639
Yeah, I've said my piece,
but I don't think it's about the money.

85
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:52,080
<i>It's personal. She has her own reasons.</i>

86
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,639
Put her on. I'll talk to her myself.

87
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:55,160
<i>Hold on, Mr. Fu.</i>

88
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:59,959
Ruan, could you please come over here?

89
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:03,399
Mr. Fu, just a moment. She's here.

90
00:08:03,399 --> 00:08:05,640
Mr. Fu wants to talk to you.

91
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:09,840
<i>Hello, this is Fu Ming Yu,
Vice President of Hengshi Air.</i>

92
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:12,320
- Hello.
<i>- Hello.</i>

93
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,320
I'll get straight to the point.

94
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:18,200
We truly look forward to having you on board.

95
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:22,600
If there's anything in our offer
that doesn't sit right with you,

96
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,280
<i>we're open to negotiations.</i>

97
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:28,080
Bo'ao's meals are better.

98
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,800
That's easy.

99
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:35,320
<i>If that's a concern,</i>

100
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:38,680
<i>I can have our head chef
prepare a meal for you before every flight.</i>

101
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:40,792
- Wouldn't that be too much trouble?
<i>- No trouble at all.</i>

102
00:08:40,792 --> 00:08:42,880
Anything else?

103
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:45,680
Ms. Ruan... Si Xian.

104
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:47,480
<i>Ms. Ruan.</i>

105
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:52,560
Nothing else, really.

106
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:55,400
I think Mr. Yan's a person of good character.

107
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:58,440
<i>His smile's warmer.</i>

108
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,880
We've never even met.

109
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:06,680
<i>What makes you think his character's better
or his smile's warmer than mine?</i>

110
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:08,160
Hello?

111
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,040
You hung up?

112
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:14,280
Looks like he doesn't remember who I am.

113
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,560
Yeah.

114
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:20,040
By the way, if you're still willing
to keep Hengshi Air on my shortlist,

115
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:22,280
there's one favor I'd like to ask of you.

116
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:25,240
Name it. Anything.

117
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,600
If Mr. Fu never figures out who I am,

118
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,560
I'd appreciate it if you don't fill him in.

119
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:32,480
Because I want nothing to do with him.

120
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:41,960
<i>- Mr. Fu. Go ahead.</i>
- Where are you?

121
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,920
<i>I was just about to head back.</i>

122
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,120
No need.

123
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:47,360
Wait for me at the Aviation Academy.

124
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:52,720
<i>Good afternoon, Tower.
Bravo-12 Tango Juliet, ready to request taxi.</i>

125
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:55,040
<i>Bravo-12 Tango Juliet, Tower.</i>

126
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:58,280
<i>Cleared to taxi via A-A1,
hold short of runway 17.</i>

127
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:00,960
<i>Via A-A1, hold short of runway 17,</i>

128
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:03,560
<i>Bravo-12 Tango Juliet.</i>

129
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:08,399
<i>Tower, Bravo-12 Tango Juliet ready,
requesting takeoff.</i>

130
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:11,799
<i>Bravo-12 Tango Juliet,
wind 170 at 2 meters per second,</i>

131
00:10:11,799 --> 00:10:14,080
<i>runway 17, cleared for takeoff.</i>

132
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,600
<i>Runway 17, cleared for takeoff,</i>

133
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,880
<i>Bravo-12 Tango Juliet.</i>

134
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:32,760
You've definitely reviewed her file, right?

135
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:35,040
Not only reviewed.

136
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:38,200
I've gone over it multiple times.

137
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:41,840
Female pilots are few and far between.

138
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:45,440
Once she joins Hengshi Air, let Captain Fan Lei
mentor her on the domestic jet.

139
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,294
And I've already told Zeng Yu

140
00:11:47,294 --> 00:11:52,120
to make her and the Z101
the centerpiece of our publicity campaign.

141
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:58,080
Mr. Fu, think about it.

142
00:11:58,080 --> 00:12:01,800
Do you really have zero memory of her?

143
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:05,440
Look at her. She's gorgeous, such a presence.

144
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:07,160
Mr. Bai.

145
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:12,320
Don't always judge people by their looks.

146
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:02,200
Ruan Si Xian, someone's here to see you.

147
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:20,400
Mr. Fu, allow me to introduce

148
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:23,040
an outstanding female pilot to you,
Ruan Si Xian.

149
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:24,639
Ms. Ruan, this is--

150
00:13:24,639 --> 00:13:26,279
No need to introduce Mr. Fu.

151
00:13:26,279 --> 00:13:28,080
Everyone knows who he is.

152
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:30,040
Hello, Ms. Ruan.

153
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:34,480
- I came here with Hengshi Air's greatest--
- Mr. Bai already filled me in.

154
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:40,040
Unfortunately, Mr. Yan of Bo'ao
made the same pitch.

155
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:45,840
And between the two,
he came across as more sincere.

156
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:51,560
Well, we can talk about other terms.

157
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,919
I can guarantee you at least 60 hours a month--

158
00:13:53,919 --> 00:13:55,440
I'm sorry.

159
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:58,200
I've got training.
Mr. Fu, please see yourself out.

160
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:02,000
Is there something you've got wrong about us?

161
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:06,880
If Hengshi Air could offer you
more opportunities and terms,

162
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:09,000
would you be willing to listen?

163
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:13,080
Mr. Fu, I don't think

164
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:16,840
we're at the point
where we can discuss terms yet.

165
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:27,880
Then what should we discuss, if not terms?
Feelings?

166
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:33,120
I'm afraid when it comes to feelings,

167
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:37,280
the one airline I can't accept is Hengshi Air.

168
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:40,560
- Ruan.
- Ruan Si Xian.

169
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:46,200
What would it take to change your mind?

170
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:51,320
When the sun rises from the west.

171
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,920
Ruan Si Xian!

172
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:06,320
You said it yourself.

173
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:10,320
If the sun rises from the west,
you'll sign with Hengshi Air.

174
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:22,840
What got him all fired up?

175
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:35,960
Mr. Fu, I took another look at
Dean Wang's list of this year's graduates.

176
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:38,120
Some of them have pretty impressive grades too.

177
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:40,440
No. I want her.

178
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:42,760
But Mr. Fu, why put all our eggs in one basket?

179
00:15:42,760 --> 00:15:45,000
There are plenty of graduates every year.

180
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,320
Let's pick someone else.

181
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,800
It has to be her.

182
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:52,080
The Corporate Publicity Department has already
been building the Z101 campaign around her.

183
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:55,400
Swap her out, and the whole plan falls apart.

184
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:56,520
Then what should we do now?

185
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:59,600
Get to the airport as fast as possible.

186
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:01,801
Head to General Aviation.

187
00:16:01,801 --> 00:16:04,400
Three, two, one.

188
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:10,159
Cheese!

189
00:16:10,159 --> 00:16:13,759
Ruan, you're stunning. Absolutely gorgeous!

190
00:16:13,759 --> 00:16:14,880
- Senior, let's take one together!
- Sure, come on.

191
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:15,920
- Us, too.
- Okay, come here.

192
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:18,360
Okay. Cheese!

193
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,759
I want to take one too!

194
00:16:19,759 --> 00:16:21,279
- Take a photo for me.
- Sure, let me.

195
00:16:21,279 --> 00:16:22,360
Come on.

196
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:25,040
You didn't have to bring flowers.

197
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:30,360
All done.

198
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,679
Thank you.

199
00:16:31,679 --> 00:16:34,120
I'm glad you remembered my graduation.

200
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:37,840
I rushed over and still missed
your big revenge moment.

201
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:38,919
So, how does it feel?

202
00:16:38,919 --> 00:16:41,520
Your anger is vented. Feel good?

203
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:42,960
Not bad, I guess.

204
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:45,600
But honestly, not as satisfying as I thought.

205
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:47,160
You're still not satisfied?

206
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:50,080
Just the double signing bonus alone
is enough to make everyone jealous.

207
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:52,360
Plus 60 guaranteed hours a month.

208
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,680
Do you know what that means?

209
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:59,000
You can sit around doing nothing
and still make more than me flying my tail off.

210
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:02,080
As if I care about that pocket change.

211
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:07,120
- Okay, fine, I do care!
- Okay, fine, I do care!

212
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:10,920
So what's your plan?

213
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:13,680
Coming back to Hengshi Air
to be my colleague again?

214
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:16,400
And eat my own words that fast?

215
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,920
Right now you're walking in there
with a double bonus

216
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,960
and the title of
Hengshi Air's top female pilot.

217
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:22,520
That's the real power move.

218
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:27,720
But when it comes down to it,
I'm just a fresh flight graduate.

219
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:32,160
Isn't double the bonus a little over the top?

220
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:34,240
Could it be a trap?

221
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:35,480
You're overthinking it.

222
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:38,200
Fu Ming Yu is a vice president of an airline.

223
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:41,000
He's not throwing double bonuses around
for laughs.

224
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:47,480
And besides, wasn't it you at New Year's
who said you'd be flying a Z101 in five years?

225
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:53,320
Now Hengshi Air's finally getting one,
and we flight attendants are all raring to go.

226
00:17:53,320 --> 00:17:54,880
Can you stay calm?

227
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:58,160
To be honest,
before I entered the Aviation Academy,

228
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:01,640
I never imagined I'd love flying this much.

229
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:04,960
And I've studied every Boeing and Airbus model.

230
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:09,280
Compared to them, the Z101
isn't just a technological leap.

231
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:12,000
It's our country's pride.

232
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:16,880
For any pilot, that's a huge draw.

233
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:19,720
What's wrong?

234
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:24,600
Ruan Si Xian,
your heart's already back at Hengshi Air.

235
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:28,200
It's already in the cockpit of that new jet.

236
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:32,600
All I hope is that when you sign
with Fu Ming Yu, you keep some dignity.

237
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:36,080
Speaking as your former colleague,
welcome back to Hengshi Air.

238
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:39,720
Like signing with Hengshi Air
means I'll fly the Z101.

239
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:44,680
The airline getting new planes and
me flying them are totally different things.

240
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:47,760
They're not handing a new model
to a rookie like me.

241
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:49,080
Why not?

242
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:51,960
"Captain" Ruan is the best.

243
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:15,840
Mr. Fu, are you okay?

244
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:30,320
I almost forgot
you two have that whole deadlock.

245
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:34,080
Only when the sun rises from the west
will you go back to Hengshi Air.

246
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:36,760
Ms. Ruan's got her pride.

247
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:39,040
I was messing with him.

248
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:44,760
However, if he ever remembers who I am
and gives me a sincere apology,

249
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:48,960
I might consider their offer.

250
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:53,160
I mean, what was Fu Ming Yu thinking,
picking a fight with our "Captain" Ruan?

251
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:56,400
Anyway, the sun doesn't rise from the west.

252
00:19:56,400 --> 00:20:00,880
So, do you want to go back or not?

253
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,640
We're here.

254
00:20:17,760 --> 00:20:19,400
We're here.

255
00:20:31,760 --> 00:20:33,000
Careful.

256
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,840
Be careful. Turbulence.

257
00:20:40,840 --> 00:20:43,160
Come on.

258
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:44,800
Here.

259
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:53,600
Who is it?

260
00:20:54,320 --> 00:20:56,160
Bai Yang?

261
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:59,680
<i>Ruan Si Xian, look!</i>

262
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:02,600
<i>The sun is rising from the west.</i>

263
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:07,440
<i>At high latitudes,
if you fly east to west at dusk,</i>

264
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:09,960
and your speed exceeds the sun's descent,

265
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:15,200
relativity makes it look like
the sun is rising from the west!

266
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:25,400
<i>Ruan Si Xian, is my smile friendly enough?</i>

267
00:21:26,360 --> 00:21:28,000
<i>The sun's rising from the west.</i>

268
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:31,040
<i>Now, will you join Hengshi Air?</i>

269
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:36,119
How could I forget about this?

270
00:21:36,119 --> 00:21:39,280
So the sun does rise from the west.

271
00:21:43,520 --> 00:21:46,200
Ms. Ruan, take another look at the contract.

272
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:49,640
If anything's not to your liking,
just say the word.

273
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:53,400
Mr. Fu, you're the same as ever.

274
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:58,840
When you set your mind to something,
nothing stands in your way, right?

275
00:22:05,040 --> 00:22:09,000
Miss Ruan, Mr. Fu and Hengshi Air
have made our position clear.

276
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:11,520
Double the signing bonus,
the newest pilot apartment.

277
00:22:11,520 --> 00:22:15,320
Plus, Mr. Fu wants you to transition to

278
00:22:15,320 --> 00:22:21,120
the new domestic model we're bringing in,
the Z101.

279
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:30,160
Why?

280
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:31,720
Why what?

281
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:34,480
I'm just a fresh graduate
straight out of the Aviation Academy.

282
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:36,920
Why would I get the Z101?

283
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:40,040
Hengshi Air's got plenty of senior pilots.

284
00:22:40,040 --> 00:22:44,480
Shouldn't the new jet
go to the most experienced ones?

285
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:46,360
In my mind,

286
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:53,040
you'll be Hengshi Air's best captain.

287
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:00,680
To give you some context,

288
00:23:00,680 --> 00:23:03,440
the Z101's first flight
is scheduled for 60 days from now.

289
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:07,320
So, welcome aboard Hengshi Air.

290
00:23:11,560 --> 00:23:14,119
<i>That wraps up the signing.</i>

291
00:23:14,119 --> 00:23:16,824
<i>We'll take care of the rest of the paperwork.</i>

292
00:23:16,824 --> 00:23:18,824
[2017]

293
00:23:34,360 --> 00:23:40,360
Welcome to Hengshi Air
as one of the first pilots on the Z101.

294
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:26,960
[Bai Yang]

295
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:29,480
<i>Good morning, Mr. Fu.</i>

296
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,680
When's the new plane touching down?

297
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:33,240
<i>Estimated arrival at 6:40 a.m.</i>

298
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:10,599
- Look! It's really here!
- It really is! Over there!

299
00:25:10,599 --> 00:25:13,840
Look! It's going through
the water cannon salute!

300
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:44,480
So beautiful!

301
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:46,280
It's made by us, made in China!

302
00:25:46,280 --> 00:25:49,560
Dad, I'm talking about that lady.

303
00:25:49,560 --> 00:25:51,920
She's really pretty.

304
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:54,840
Daddy's never seen
a female pilot before either.

305
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:40,800
Come on, Ruan, let me show you around.

306
00:26:40,800 --> 00:26:42,160
This is the lobby.

307
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:44,240
The elevator goes straight up to your place.

308
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:48,160
The fountain runs 24/7,
and lights up at night, too.

309
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:52,280
Mr. Fu had a foreign designer do the facade.

310
00:26:52,280 --> 00:26:55,440
Classy, understated, top-notch.

311
00:26:56,360 --> 00:26:58,039
And here's a little secret.

312
00:26:58,039 --> 00:27:02,480
Mr. Fu lives here too. Right above you.

313
00:27:02,480 --> 00:27:05,880
Mr. Fu? Above me?

314
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:07,240
But he's hardly ever here.

315
00:27:07,240 --> 00:27:11,120
Just crashes for a night
when he's too drained to head home.

316
00:27:11,120 --> 00:27:12,640
Come on.

317
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:17,480
Mr. Bai, you can drop me here.

318
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:18,880
I'll find my own way up.

319
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:20,280
It's no trouble. Let me walk you up.

320
00:27:20,280 --> 00:27:22,240
Really.

321
00:27:22,240 --> 00:27:23,880
I'm good. I've got it.

322
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:28,800
Alright then. Here's your key card.

323
00:27:28,800 --> 00:27:31,720
The passcode is your birthday.
You can change it anytime.

324
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:34,516
Call me if there's anything you need.

325
00:27:35,195 --> 00:27:36,307
I'm the special assistant after all.

326
00:27:36,307 --> 00:27:37,440
Appreciate it.

327
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:41,960
Don't mention it.
Well then, welcome to Hengshi Air.

328
00:27:41,960 --> 00:27:43,520
Good luck.

329
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:45,680
Thank you.

330
00:28:07,799 --> 00:28:10,040
Coming.

331
00:28:11,840 --> 00:28:13,560
Come on in.

332
00:28:17,400 --> 00:28:19,039
Just going to stand here?

333
00:28:19,039 --> 00:28:20,640
Change your shoes.

334
00:28:23,060 --> 00:28:24,960
Oh my god.

335
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:27,320
So this is your new place.

336
00:28:27,320 --> 00:28:29,720
It's huge!

337
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:35,000
And you've got an ocean view!

338
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:41,640
Nice sofa. Nice color. So plush.

339
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:44,160
Oh my god.

340
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:45,960
And you have this massive kitchen.

341
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:48,480
Do you even cook? Do you even know how?

342
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:51,520
Giving you a kitchen this big
is practically a waste.

343
00:28:52,560 --> 00:28:56,480
Ruan, can I check out your bedroom?

344
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:58,040
Go ahead.

345
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:04,960
This bed is incredible.

346
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:07,240
Feels like at least two meters wide.

347
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:09,720
Perfect for two.

348
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:12,280
How much did this cost?

349
00:29:15,360 --> 00:29:17,000
What's up?

350
00:29:19,520 --> 00:29:23,120
You have a bathtub too?

351
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:26,920
So what if I do?

352
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:29,080
My own failures are bad enough,

353
00:29:29,080 --> 00:29:32,560
but watching my friend's success
is the real heartbreaker.

354
00:29:32,560 --> 00:29:34,040
Fine.

355
00:29:34,040 --> 00:29:38,600
If you ever want to stay over,
you're welcome anytime, alright?

356
00:29:38,600 --> 00:29:40,800
Really?

357
00:29:40,800 --> 00:29:44,440
Then I'm going to check out my study.

358
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:56,960
So Fu Ming Yu lives upstairs?

359
00:29:56,960 --> 00:29:58,480
No wonder.

360
00:29:58,480 --> 00:30:01,640
He always seems so calm every time I see him.

361
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:06,680
Living in a place like this,
what problems could he have?

362
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:11,880
Uncle, don't you worry.

363
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:14,280
Ruan's made it now.

364
00:30:14,280 --> 00:30:16,080
She's a real pilot.

365
00:30:16,080 --> 00:30:17,520
Just look at this place.

366
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:21,280
Almost a carbon copy of our boss's setup.

367
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,240
That's a stretch.

368
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:26,240
A stretch? It's amazing.

369
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:28,520
I think Fu Ming Yu
is actually serious this time.

370
00:30:28,520 --> 00:30:31,240
I heard Captain Yue Yang
lives on this floor too.

371
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:35,160
Everyone else is downstairs,
some even sharing rooms.

372
00:30:35,160 --> 00:30:36,560
You know what that means?

373
00:30:36,560 --> 00:30:38,480
It means that to Hengshi Air,

374
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:43,640
you're their number one investment.

375
00:30:43,640 --> 00:30:46,200
All right, have some water.

376
00:30:47,560 --> 00:30:51,720
But I still feel like I'm getting way too much.

377
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:54,080
This place doesn't feel earned.

378
00:30:54,080 --> 00:30:56,000
I'm just a rookie.

379
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:57,880
Could there be some kind of catch?

380
00:30:57,880 --> 00:30:59,080
Look at you.

381
00:30:59,080 --> 00:31:01,800
That "I don't deserve this" crap again.
Cut it out.

382
00:31:01,800 --> 00:31:05,200
If you didn't deserve all this,
would Fu Ming Yu have bothered?

383
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:07,360
Chasing the sun and all that?

384
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:09,480
It's not that I don't trust myself.

385
00:31:09,480 --> 00:31:12,840
I don't trust him.

386
00:31:12,840 --> 00:31:14,920
Three years,

387
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:18,720
and he does a one-eighty
on how he treats employees?

388
00:31:18,720 --> 00:31:20,360
Why not?

389
00:31:20,360 --> 00:31:22,080
You were top of your class back then,

390
00:31:22,080 --> 00:31:25,400
and you may become
Hengshi Air's top captain someday.

391
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:29,600
You're not that flight attendant anymore.
Things are different now.

392
00:31:29,600 --> 00:31:32,160
You've got a point.

393
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:36,440
I asked for too little.
I should've asked for triple the bonus.

394
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:39,720
Rob from the Fu to give to the poor.

395
00:31:39,720 --> 00:31:42,640
Rob from the Fu to give to the poor!

396
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:46,080
Rob from the Fu to give to the poor!

397
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:51,240
Live a good life!

398
00:31:54,519 --> 00:31:56,480
Rob from the who?

399
00:32:04,800 --> 00:32:08,480
Tong Le, the delivery's here. Go unload it.

400
00:32:11,735 --> 00:32:13,735
[Fulai Lounge]

401
00:32:14,360 --> 00:32:17,519
I'll move these inside.
Get the rest off the truck.

402
00:32:17,519 --> 00:32:18,800
On it.

403
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:20,480
Great work, everyone.

404
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:22,480
You got it, boss.

405
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:31,360
You've got it so clean?

406
00:32:32,360 --> 00:32:38,640
Boss Bian, haven't we free laborers
been at it a little too long?

407
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:40,519
You're tired already?

408
00:32:40,519 --> 00:32:42,920
You need to toughen up.

409
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:47,480
That's enough.

410
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:49,880
She's not even paying us.

411
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:54,799
We haven't worked that long, have we?

412
00:32:54,799 --> 00:32:58,200
Work-life balance, my friend.

413
00:32:59,360 --> 00:33:01,559
Alright, let's go upstairs for some fresh air.

414
00:33:01,559 --> 00:33:04,200
- Let's go.
- Where are we going?

415
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:08,039
Second floor. Better air.

416
00:33:08,039 --> 00:33:09,480
I need a break.

417
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:11,200
Slow down.

418
00:33:11,200 --> 00:33:13,960
Xuan's not around anyway.

419
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:15,560
Let's go.

420
00:33:20,320 --> 00:33:23,640
Way better out here.

421
00:33:38,240 --> 00:33:41,160
Wipe your mouth. You're drooling.

422
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:48,920
Where did Xuan even find such a handsome guy?

423
00:33:48,920 --> 00:33:51,640
She didn't find them.

424
00:33:51,640 --> 00:33:54,120
They just showed up.

425
00:33:56,240 --> 00:34:01,960
And she didn't share with her besties?

426
00:34:01,960 --> 00:34:03,920
Share with you for what?

427
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:06,840
You don't even believe in love.

428
00:34:06,840 --> 00:34:12,920
That's because the right guy
never showed up in my first 26 years.

429
00:34:12,920 --> 00:34:14,400
You think he's the one?

430
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:15,920
Tong Le?

431
00:34:16,720 --> 00:34:18,320
"Together?" No, don't go there.

432
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:20,760
Together makes it weird.

433
00:34:20,760 --> 00:34:22,480
You called me?

434
00:34:24,360 --> 00:34:25,840
So it's Tong Le? His name?

435
00:34:25,840 --> 00:34:27,840
Yeah.

436
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:30,480
What were you thinking?

437
00:34:32,440 --> 00:34:33,920
Let me introduce.

438
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:37,480
This is my buddy from a music festival.

439
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:41,080
And these two are my ride-or-die besties.

440
00:34:41,080 --> 00:34:43,880
Hi, I'm Si Xiao Zhen.

441
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:45,800
Hi.

442
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:48,679
- Hello, I'm Ruan Si Xian.
- Hello.

443
00:34:48,679 --> 00:34:49,960
Back to work.

444
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:51,640
On it.

445
00:34:51,640 --> 00:34:54,760
"Hi, I'm Si Xiao Zhen."

446
00:34:54,760 --> 00:34:57,280
You're mocking me! Look at her!

447
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:59,480
What's with the fake sweet voice?

448
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:01,960
Who said, "the wise do not fall in love?"

449
00:35:01,960 --> 00:35:03,760
And "only fools bite the hook above?"

450
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:05,199
Says you!

451
00:35:05,199 --> 00:35:06,960
You are ganging up on me. I'm mad now.

452
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:12,120
I haven't even brought up
you going back to your ex-employer.

453
00:35:12,120 --> 00:35:13,880
What about it?

454
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:16,920
My ex-employer is one hell of a deal.

455
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:20,640
Double the bonus, flying a brand-new jet.

456
00:35:20,640 --> 00:35:24,280
Now that calls for a drink.

457
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:26,000
One doesn't bite the hook,

458
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:30,040
and one's scoring a fat pay raise,
grinding hard.

459
00:35:30,679 --> 00:35:33,040
- What about you?
- Me?

460
00:35:33,040 --> 00:35:36,760
I'm out living it up every night.

461
00:35:39,079 --> 00:35:40,760
- It's raining.
- It's raining.

462
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:43,480
Tong Le, get things inside now!

463
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,880
- Don't let them get wet.
- Okay!

464
00:35:44,880 --> 00:35:46,880
Go!

465
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:49,119
It's pouring.

466
00:35:49,119 --> 00:35:50,920
So heavy.

467
00:36:28,119 --> 00:36:29,920
What are you staring at?

468
00:36:29,920 --> 00:36:32,599
- What are you staring at?
- The rain.

469
00:36:32,599 --> 00:36:34,200
Watching the rain.

470
00:36:34,200 --> 00:36:35,559
Me too, then.

471
00:36:35,559 --> 00:36:37,119
It's so heavy!

472
00:36:37,119 --> 00:36:41,000
- You're so annoying!
- What's your deal?

473
00:37:01,160 --> 00:37:03,520
<i>The airport expressway is a mess this morning.</i>

474
00:37:03,520 --> 00:37:07,040
<i>You'd better set up early, or take a detour.</i>

475
00:37:07,040 --> 00:37:08,480
<i>Want to ride together?</i>

476
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:10,760
<i>I'm right by the Mingchen Mansion.</i>

477
00:37:10,760 --> 00:37:13,600
Mr. Bai, are you alone?

478
00:37:14,920 --> 00:37:16,840
<i>Mr. Fu is here too.</i>

479
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:21,280
<i>Then I'll pass.</i>

480
00:37:25,640 --> 00:37:28,400
Mr. Fu, Ruan Si Xian's
probably not at her place.

481
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:30,440
Maybe we should just go?

482
00:37:31,520 --> 00:37:33,600
"Probably?"

483
00:37:43,360 --> 00:37:45,800
Isn't that her over there?

484
00:37:47,680 --> 00:37:49,200
Drive.

485
00:38:00,080 --> 00:38:01,920
[Your driver has arrived.]

486
00:38:10,880 --> 00:38:13,880
Sir, to Hengshi Air.

487
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:16,079
Sorry, but this is my ride.

488
00:38:16,079 --> 00:38:18,719
Just let me have it. I'm in a hurry.

489
00:38:18,719 --> 00:38:20,119
I'm going to be late for a meeting.

490
00:38:20,119 --> 00:38:22,360
No. Get out.

491
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:28,600
Please, just let me take it.

492
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:30,560
My meeting is really important.

493
00:38:30,560 --> 00:38:33,639
No. Mine is important, too.

494
00:38:33,639 --> 00:38:37,360
Please, I'm begging you. Help me out.

495
00:38:37,360 --> 00:38:43,160
I had dinner with friends last night,
had a few drinks, and overslept.

496
00:38:43,160 --> 00:38:45,760
Miss, it's a booked ride.

497
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:49,000
I can't take you. It'd be against the rules.

498
00:38:54,840 --> 00:38:56,440
Sir, let's go.

499
00:39:08,520 --> 00:39:13,600
Did you offend her at the academy?

500
00:39:23,840 --> 00:39:29,520
Offend her at the academy? Me?

501
00:39:36,040 --> 00:39:38,360
Send me her WeChat.

502
00:39:39,640 --> 00:39:41,360
What are you waiting for? Send it to me.

503
00:39:41,360 --> 00:39:43,000
Understood.

504
00:39:44,240 --> 00:39:47,960
[Ruan Si Xian's contact card]

505
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:14,199
Fancy running into you. You made it after all.

506
00:41:14,199 --> 00:41:17,160
Fancy that. You're coming to Hengshi Air too?

507
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:20,320
I'm here to check in
at the Human Resources Department.

508
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:28,720
Just graduated?

509
00:41:34,240 --> 00:41:37,880
I figured.
Only a clueless rookie would act like that.

510
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:39,960
Started line training yet?

511
00:41:39,960 --> 00:41:41,119
Not yet.

512
00:41:41,119 --> 00:41:44,120
I get that we had that little run-in
at the apartment,

513
00:41:44,760 --> 00:41:46,320
but I'm not petty.

514
00:41:46,320 --> 00:41:49,160
There are some things I should clue you in on.

515
00:41:49,160 --> 00:41:51,680
In this industry, seniority matters.

516
00:41:51,680 --> 00:41:55,880
When you start line training,
keep your eyes open.

517
00:41:55,880 --> 00:41:58,599
Know your place, show some respect.

518
00:41:58,599 --> 00:42:01,280
Fighting for an elevator spot is one thing,

519
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:05,679
but if you pull that on a plane,
what will the purser think of you?

520
00:42:05,679 --> 00:42:08,599
If you end up on one of my flights,

521
00:42:08,599 --> 00:42:12,640
I have zero tolerance for that.

522
00:42:20,039 --> 00:42:21,880
What are you looking at?

523
00:42:26,250 --> 00:42:29,480
Anyway, we'll probably be working together,

524
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:31,080
so let's do this properly.

525
00:42:31,080 --> 00:42:34,000
Cabin Crew, Division Four, Ni Tong.

526
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:42,880
Flight Operations Department, No. Six Squadron,
Z101 Pilot, Ruan Si Xian.

527
00:42:44,120 --> 00:42:45,960
By the way,

528
00:42:45,960 --> 00:42:51,000
if you ever work one of my flights,
don't drink within 24 hours of duty.

529
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:54,480
And I've got zero tolerance
for late flight attendants.

530
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:59,600
Ruan Si Xian?

531
00:43:01,600 --> 00:43:02,920
Hello, who's this?

532
00:43:02,920 --> 00:43:05,760
<i>Ms. Ruan. It's me, Yan An.</i>

533
00:43:05,760 --> 00:43:07,840
Mr. Yan. How can I help you?

534
00:43:07,840 --> 00:43:10,960
I thought you were about to sign with us.

535
00:43:10,960 --> 00:43:13,320
How'd you end up at Hengshi Air?

536
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:18,160
Well, Mr. Fu is quite the catch.

537
00:43:18,160 --> 00:43:22,800
After all, talented, graceful,

538
00:43:22,800 --> 00:43:26,360
<i>imposing, gentle,</i>

539
00:43:26,360 --> 00:43:31,360
dignified, handsome, and dashing...

540
00:43:31,360 --> 00:43:34,840
None of that applies to him.

